**Why start here**: Flashcards are the core feature. They exercise the full vertical stack: types, storage abstraction, algorithm (SM-2), context, UI with animation, navigation. Once this works, the foundation is proven and adding lessons/quizzes is incremental.

### Phase 2: Lessons + Courses

