**Goal**: Practice conversations with an AI tutor.

**Packages to install**: `ai`, `@ai-sdk/openai` (or `@ai-sdk/anthropic`)

**Files to create**:

1. `src/app/api/conversation/route.ts` -- API route
2. `src/components/conversation/message-bubble.tsx`
